        <mxCell id="title" value="TABEL KARDINALITAS — FLOZ Database&lt;br/&gt;29 entitas · 57 relasi · sumber: src/database/migrations + src/app/Models" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1F4E78;strokeColor=#1F4E78;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="1000" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg" value="&lt;b&gt;Cara baca multiplicity (UML 2.x):&lt;/b&gt; angka di sisi LAWAN menjawab &amp;quot;berapa instance per 1 instance di sisi seberang&amp;quot;.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contoh baris #3 (AcademicYear &amp;quot;1..1&amp;quot; — &amp;quot;0..*&amp;quot; Semester):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;• 1 Semester milik tepat &lt;b&gt;1..1&lt;/b&gt; AcademicYear&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;1 AcademicYear punya &lt;b&gt;0..*&lt;/b&gt; Semester (0 atau lebih)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notasi multiplicity:&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;1..1&lt;/b&gt; = wajib tepat 1 (FK NOT NULL)&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;0..1&lt;/b&gt; = paling banyak 1 (FK nullable)&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;0..*&lt;/b&gt; = nol atau lebih&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;1..*&lt;/b&gt; = satu atau lebih&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cascade = Ya&lt;/b&gt; berarti hapus parent → semua child terhapus otomatis (composition, simbol diamond hitam di class diagram)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="104" width="1000" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
